Support GTSAM 4.3.0

GTSAM 4.3.0 removed or moved several APIs that gtsam_points 1.2.2 uses:

- gtsam/base/make_shared.h, gtsam::make_shared and
  GTSAM_MAKE_ALIGNED_OPERATOR_NEW (borglab/gtsam#2579).
- LevenbergMarquardtParams::{diagonalDamping,minDiagonal,maxDiagonal} moved
  into LevenbergMarquardtParams::dampingParams.
- NonlinearOptimizer::graph_ became a shared_ptr.
- NoiseModelFactorN moved to gtsam/nonlinear/NoiseModelFactorN.h.
- Eigen/Eigenvalues is no longer included transitively.

The changes keep building with GTSAM 4.2 and 4.3a1: make_shared.h and
NoiseModelFactorN.h are detected with __has_include, the damping parameters
are detected by member (4.3a1 and 4.3.0 share GTSAM_VERSION_NUMERIC), and the
optimizers use the public graph() accessor. gtsam::make_shared calls go
through gtsam_points::make_shared_ptr, named so that it cannot be ambiguous
with std::make_shared or boost::make_shared in downstream code.

Tested by building the library and the tests, and running ctest, against
GTSAM 4.2.2, 4.3a1 and 4.3.0.

